Package: deconflate
Type: Package
Title: Comorbidity Adjustment of Disease Impact Estimates
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Philip", "Rasmussen", email = "phr@sund.ku.dk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adjusts ("de-conflates") single-disease impact estimates for
    statistical associations between diseases, so that impacts can be
    aggregated without double counting. Implements the published proportional
    approximation of Rasmussen et al. (2022) <doi:10.1016/j.prevetmed.2022.105617>,
    an exact simultaneous solution of the underlying additive impact
    equations, and a global model that fits a maximum-entropy distribution of
    disease combinations by iterative proportional fitting and incorporates
    specified pairwise impact interactions. Includes productivity-gap
    estimation, Shapley attribution, hazard-ratio conversion, Monte Carlo
    propagation of input uncertainty with rejection reporting, and
    importance reweighting of draws for scenario analysis.
